      "response": {
        "text": "Root cause: The geo-cache service experienced an out-of-memory (OOM) event, evicting all keys and becoming unavailable. This forced geo-service to bypass the cache and send all requests directly to the upstream maps API, quickly exceeding its quota and resulting in 429 errors.\n\nAction taken: Restarted the geo-cache service, restoring cache availability and reducing load on the upstream API.\n\nAffected service: geo-service.",
